==Venues==
Twenty stadiums in twenty host cities were selected for the tournament, split evenly between the two host nations. Ten venues are located in [[Balisca]] and ten in [[Sanrobonia]]. The selection of Baliscan venues spans the confederation's major urban centres, from the capital [[Castejón]] to the coastal cities of [[Concepción]] and [[Valparaíso]]. The Sanrobonian venues are distributed across the archipelago's diverse regions, from the capital [[Martapura]] in the Central-West to the northern cities of [[Sanropura]] and [[Telukuba]], the eastern port of [[Taluate]], the southeastern hub of [[Labuan]], and the western city of [[Kutawaringin]].

The [[Campo Simpliciano]] in [[Castejón]] will host the final, while the [[Stadion Agung Martapura]] in [[Martapura]] will host the opening match. Both venues underwent significant renovation to meet AFA requirements.

