==Draw==
The draw for the group stage took place on TBA 2026 at TBA. The 36 teams were allocated to three pots based on the [[AFA World Rankings]]. Pot 1 contained the twelve seeded teams, including both host nations. Pots 2 and 3 contained the remaining 24 teams, allocated based on geographical criteria and ranking.

